// 地址复用时默认构造不能误释放残留拥有地址；new 与运行时数组必须初始化。
struct DefaultOwned {
    int32 kind;
    bool ready;
    float32 scale;
    String text;
    List<String> values;
    String fn() callback;
};
String fn() retained(String mut& text) { return fn() { text }; }
int64 main() {
    for (int64 i = 0; i < 20; i = i + 1) {
        String parentCallback="parent callback";
        DefaultOwned local;
        local.kind = 7;
        local.text = "parent";
        local.values.push("owned");
        local.callback = retained(&parentCallback);
        DefaultOwned mut& owned = heap DefaultOwned;
        assert(owned.kind == 0 && !owned.ready && owned.scale == 0.0);
        assert(owned.values.len() == 0);
        owned.text = "child";
        owned.values.push("child value");
        owned.callback = retained(&owned.text);
        assert(owned.callback() == "child");
        assert(local.kind == 7 && local.text == "parent" && local.values[0] == "owned");
        assert(local.callback() == "parent callback");
        delete owned;
        assert(local.text == "parent" && local.callback() == "parent callback");
        String words[] = new[3];
        words[0] = format("{}", i);
        words[1] = "first";
        words[1] = "second";
        assert(words[0] == format("{}", i) && words[1] == "second");
        delete words;
        int32 numbers[] = new[3];
        assert(numbers[0] == 0 && numbers[2] == 0);
    }
    println("allocated default ownership OK");
    return 0;
}
